        <mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The Contributor opens the tour's &quot;Publish&quot; step in the Studio, the &quot;Restricted access&quot; panel." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system shows the access status and the passcode field (it can only be enabled when the tour is Draft, Rejected or Needs changes)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-110" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The Contributor enters a passcode and taps &quot;Enable restricted access&quot;. E1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="320" x="-160" y="405" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system (Tour) stores the passcode as a hash (scrypt), increases the passcode version and moves the tour to &quot;Restricted&quot; with a conditional update statement. E2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The system shows &quot;Restricted access enabled&quot;, the number of testers who have unlocked it and the /tour/:id/unlock link to copy. A1, A3, A4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="320" x="-160" y="815" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The Contributor sends the link and passcode to the test group." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="1035" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. The tester opens /tour/:id/unlock (signing in first if not signed in)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="1170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="8. The system checks whether the tester has already unlocked it. A2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="1305" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="9. The tester enters the passcode and taps &quot;Unlock&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="1440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="10. The system records the attempt, counts failures in 15 minutes, compares the hash and stores access by passcode version. E3, E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="320" x="-160" y="1560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="11. The system opens the tour page with the &quot;Trial version (restricted access)&quot; label; the tester listens to the tour as in UC#04. E5, A5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="320" x="-160" y="1780" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="2030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E1. Empty passcode → &quot;Please enter the access code&quot;; contains spaces → &quot;The access code must not contain spaces&quot;; wrong length → &quot;The access code must have 6 to 32 characters&quot; (400)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="250" x="355" y="333" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E2. The tour is not in a status that allows enabling → 409; not the author → 403; disabling a tour that is not restricted → 409." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="568" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E6. Submitting for review or publishing while the tour is restricted → 409 &quot;… please turn off this mode before submitting for review&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="795" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. Wrong passcode → 403 &quot;Incorrect access code&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="1570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E4. 5 failures in 15 minutes → 429 &quot;You have entered a wrong code too many times, please try again in 15 minutes&quot;, even when the code is right." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="250" x="355" y="1660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E5. The tour is no longer restricted or the code has changed → 404; back to the code entry page &quot;The access code has changed…&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="1795" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.1. The Contributor chooses &quot;Change access code&quot;, enters a new code and taps &quot;Save new code&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-510" y="1005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.2. The system increases the version and deletes all old access; testers must enter the new code." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-510" y="1145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="24" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.3. The Contributor chooses &quot;Disable restricted access&quot; and confirms &quot;Disable access&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-510" y="1285" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="25" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.4. The system moves the tour back to Draft and deletes the access records and attempts." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-510" y="1410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="26" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A2. The tester has already unlocked with the current passcode version (or is the author) → goes straight to the trial version." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-910" y="1410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="27" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A3. Edit the tour content while restricted: the tour stays &quot;Restricted&quot; and testers see the new content." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-1310" y="1005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="28" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A4. To make it public: the Contributor disables restricted access (A1.3), then submits for review (UC#15)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-1710" y="1005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="29" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A5. Offline download: the tester downloads the trial version to the device as in UC#03; the download is not counted in the statistics." vertex="1">
